                    We are an international high fashion company looking for a highly experienced ClickUp specialist to organize and structure our entire company inside ClickUp from A to Z.



This is not a basic VA role.



You must be capable of building simple, efficient, and scalable systems for:



* legal;

* administration;

* accounting;

* logistics;

* wholesale;

* retail;

* production;

* collection development;

* R&D;

* quality control;

* international teams and communication.



Our goal is simple:

make a complex international business feel easy, clear, fast, and organized for both management and tea
mbers.



You must know how to:



* build dashboards, workflows, automations, SOPs, and reporting systems;

* simplify communication and follow-up;

* reduce operational chaos and unnecessary back-and-forth;

* create intuitive systems that teams actually enjoy using.



IMPORTANT:

This is a real operational role, not just “availability”.



Work structure:



* approximately 80?ST hours (9 AM – 6 PM CEST);

* approximately 10% USA hours;

* approximately 10% Asia hours.



Fashion, luxury, ecommerce, Shopify, ERP, logistics, and international operations experience are major advantages.



Please send:



* CV;

* ClickUp portfolio/screenshots;

* Loom videos or examples;

* references/case studies.



